sentences.t:
Si mihi non animo fixum immotumque sederet,
ne cui me vinclo vellem sociare iugali,
postquam primus amor deceptam morte fefellit;

sentences.l:
If to me not in my mind fixed and unmoved it were settled,
that to no one with a bond I should wish to join myself in marriage,
after my first love, me deceived, by death has cheated;

sentences.t:
Non coeptae adsurgunt turres, non arma iuventus
exercet, portusve aut propugnacula bello
tuta parant;

sentences.l:
The begun towers do not rise, not arms the youth
exercises, nor harbours or bulwarks for war
safe prepare;
